~ start
if not Global.donation_verifier 
	James: The bridge is unstable right now young lad
	James: maybe u should visit the other village
	=> END

else
	if not Global.tree_verifier
		James: Woahh!! stop there young lad
		James: its still dangerous aroung the bridge
		James: It collapsed yesterday when we were trying to fix it 
		James: but were running out of wood 
		James: you take my errand, fetch me some wood in mount chou for me
		James: we are urgently in need of wood, the people across this bridge needed some donations
		James: we're running out of time
		James: you'll met jonh there, my old friend, he'll greet you there
		set Global.has_met_james = true
		if Global.done_meeting_john
			James: did you meet john already?
	else
		james: thanks lad 
		James: Im off to fix the bridge now 
		set Global.has_help_james = true
		
=> END